			"notes": {
				"rationale": "A modal is a VERB of its own with verbType Mod, whether or not an infinitive follows (de/modal-is-a-verb). With raus and no infinitive it forms no particle verb such as hinausmüssen, so muss is a single-member VERB müssen.",
